WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.016
That task you keep putting off?

00:00:02.286 --> 00:00:03.535
It's not too big.

00:00:03.755 --> 00:00:05.383
Starting is just hard.

00:00:05.753 --> 00:00:07.506
So try the two-minute rule.

00:00:07.876 --> 00:00:09.748
If it takes less than two minutes,

00:00:09.788 --> 00:00:10.652
do it now.

00:00:11.022 --> 00:00:11.974
If it's bigger,

00:00:12.014 --> 00:00:13.701
just do the first two minutes.

00:00:14.071 --> 00:00:15.331
Don't read the book.

00:00:15.401 --> 00:00:16.644
Read one page.

00:00:16.964 --> 00:00:18.204
Don't go for a run.

00:00:18.274 --> 00:00:19.420
Put on your shoes.

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:21.152
Don't clean the kitchen.

00:00:21.222 --> 00:00:22.430
Wash one plate.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.858
Once you start,

00:00:23.898 --> 00:00:25.395
you usually keep going.

00:00:25.815 --> 00:00:26.665
Two minutes.

00:00:26.835 --> 00:00:27.783
Start now.
